{
  "key": 21602,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, man... My boss is going to be\n",
        "angry...\r",
        "The FARFETCH’D that cut trees for\n",
        "charcoal took off in the forest.\r",
        "Can you catch them for me?\n",
        "FARFETCH’D have sensitive ears.\r",
        "If you step on a branch, they will face\n",
        "toward you. That’s your chance.\r",
        "Sneak up from behind and catch them...\n",
        "Do you think you can do that?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow! You found a FARFETCH’D!\n",
        "Thank you!\r",
        "But...\n",
        "There is one more missing.\r",
        "If you step on a branch, it will face\n",
        "that way, remember?\r",
        "That’s your chance to catch it.\n",
        "Sneak up on it slowly from behind."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow!\n",
        "You got me both of them.\f",
        "Thank you so much!\r",
        "My boss’s Pokémon won’t obey me,\n",
        "because I don’t have a Badge.\r",
        "Phew. You saved me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00003",
      "en_US": "FARFETCH’D: Kwaa!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00004",
      "en_US": "FARFETCH’D: Kwaa!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00005",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} caught the FARFETCH’D!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah!\n",
        "My Far and Fetch’d!\r",
        "You found them for us, kid?\n",
        "Without them, we wouldn’t be able to\f",
        "cut trees for charcoal.\r",
        "Thanks, kid!\r",
        "Now, how can I thank you...?\n",
        "I know! Here, take this.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00007",
      "garbage": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s the HM Cut. Teach that to a\n",
        "Pokémon to clear small trees.\r",
        "Of course, you have to have the Gym\n",
        "Badge from Azalea to use it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00009",
      "garbage": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to apprentice as a charcoal\n",
        "maker with me?\r",
        "You’ll be first-rate in ten years!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "What am I doing?\r",
        "I’m shaking trees using Headbutt.\r",
        "It’s fun. Here, you try it with your\n",
        "Pokémon, too! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to try it with your\n",
        "Pokémon? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "I see...\n",
        "Take care of its head."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00014",
      "en_US": "Which Pokémon should learn it?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm...\n",
        "Even I couldn’t teach an Egg a move.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Sorry...\n",
        "That Pokémon cannot learn Headbutt.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} is trying to learn\n",
        "Headbutt.\r",
        "But {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} can’t learn more\n",
        "than four moves.\r",
        "Delete an older move to make\n",
        "room for Headbutt? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Is it OK to forget the\n",
        "move {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00019",
      "en_US": "Stop trying to teach Headbutt? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00020",
      "en_US": "1,{PAUSE 20} 2,{PAUSE 20} and...{PAUSE 20} ...{PAUSE 20} Poof!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00021",
      "en_US": "1,{PAUSE 20} 2,{PAUSE 20} and...{PAUSE 20} ...{PAUSE 20} Poof!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "There. How do you like it?\n",
        "Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} looks stronger!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\n",
        "has already learned Headbutt.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} forgot how to\n",
        "use {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "And..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00025",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} learned Headbutt."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00026",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} learned Headbutt!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips!\r",
        "Ilex Forest is so overgrown with trees\n",
        "that you can’t see the sky.\r",
        "Please watch out for items that may\n",
        "have been dropped."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Ilex Forest Shrine...\r",
        "It’s a tribute to the forest’s\n",
        "protector..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Kimono Girl, Kimono Girl, lost and all\n",
        "alone. Poor girl lost in the dark\f",
        "Ilex Forest.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "What?\n",
        "You remember me from Violet City?\f",
        "You must be imagining.\r",
        "Anyway, will you show me\n",
        "how to get out of this forest? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "You will...?\n",
        "Aren’t you lost in the forest as well?\f",
        "How do you know how to get out of here?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Me oh my...\n",
        "You are lost yourself, aren’t you?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow! Are you going to\n",
        "show me how to get out?\f",
        "You are such a smart Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00034",
      "en_US": "See you.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "FARFETCH’D noticed you!\n",
        "It seems to face the direction of the\f",
        "noise when you step on a branch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00036",
      "en_US": "You need to catch it from behind."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "You snuck up and caught it from\n",
        "behind before it noticed you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00038",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a PICHU...!\n",
        "One of its ears is spiky!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00039",
      "en_US": [
        "It wants to join your party.\n",
        "Let it join you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00040",
      "en_US": [
        "Spiky-eared PICHU has joined\n",
        "your party!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00041",
      "en_US": "...Your party is full!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00042",
      "en_US": [
        "...Your party is full!\r",
        "First go store a Pokémon in a PC Box."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00043",
      "en_US": "Spiky-eared PICHU: Zapzap chu!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00044",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the Poké Ball!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00045",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to give a nickname\n",
        "to the Spiky-eared PICHU? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00046",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, hey!\n",
        "You should not tamper with that shrine!\f",
        "People are said to disappear.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00047",
      "en_US": [
        "Kids and Pokémon sometimes disappear\n",
        "around this shrine.\r",
        "It is believed that a Pokémon which\n",
        "wanders across time does that.\r",
        "It is truly a strange thing...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, well, this must be...\r",
        "This must be the PICHU that has lived in\n",
        "this forest for some time.\r",
        "When I saw it the first time, it looked\n",
        "lonely. It is full of energy today.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00049",
      "en_US": [
        "I see.\n",
        "It seems that these old friends\f",
        "finally meet again after a long time.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00050",
      "en_US": [
        "You are carrying a lot of Pokémon.\r",
        "Why don’t you store one of them\n",
        "at the Pokémon Center?\f",
        "I will take care of it in the mean time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00051",
      "en_US": [
        "Being with friends should make it happy.\n",
        "Take good care of it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00052",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, here it is!\n",
        "Young Pokémon Trainer,\f",
        "I will give you this Poké Ball.\r",
        "I used to use them when I was younger.\r",
        "Don’t worry.\n",
        "It’s still in good condition.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00053",
      "en_US": [
        "It seems that Spiky-eared PICHU\n",
        "wants to stay in your Poké Ball.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00054",
      "en_US": [
        "You named it {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}?\n",
        "Such a cute name!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00055",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s been waiting for you\n",
        "all this time.\r",
        "Talk to it. That’ll make it happy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00056",
      "en_US": [
        "Ethan: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Have you heard of the legend of\f",
        "the shrine?\r",
        "They say that people disappear when\n",
        "they tamper with it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00057",
      "en_US": [
        "Lyra: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Have you heard of the legend of\f",
        "the shrine?\r",
        "They say that people disappear when\n",
        "they tamper with it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00058",
      "en_US": [
        "Ethan: ...\n",
        "What was that?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00059",
      "en_US": [
        "Lyra: ...\n",
        "What was that?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00060",
      "en_US": [
        "Ethan: Traveling through time\n",
        "sure doesn’t feel good.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00061",
      "en_US": [
        "Lyra: Traveling through time\n",
        "sure doesn’t feel good.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00062",
      "en_US": "Hey, my MARILL!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00063",
      "en_US": "Hey, my MARILL!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00064",
      "en_US": [
        "I thought I would never see you again!\r",
        "Wait a sec...\n",
        "So we must be back to our time!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00065",
      "en_US": [
        "I missed you so much!\r",
        "Wait a sec...\n",
        "So we must be back to our time!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00066",
      "en_US": [
        "It was all so bizarre.\n",
        "But now that we are safely back to our\f",
        "time and Team Rocket’s terrible design\f",
        "fell through, we can say...\f",
        "all’s well that ends well, right?\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you never cease to\n",
        "inspire great adventures!\r",
        "It sure was an exhausting day, though.\n",
        "I better get going.\r",
        "See you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0115_D36R0101_00067",
      "en_US": [
        "It was all so bizarre.\n",
        "But now that we are safely back to our\f",
        "time and Team Rocket’s terrible design\f",
        "fell through, we can say...\f",
        "all’s well that ends well, right?\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you never cease to\n",
        "inspire great adventures!\r",
        "It sure was an exhausting day, though.\n",
        "I better get going.\r",
        "See you!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
